<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>HiveK Campaign Collaboration Revocation</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f7f9fc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333333;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #f7f9fc;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid #eef2f5;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444 0%, #dc2626 100%);
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .content h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #1f2937;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .content p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #4b5563;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .campaign-details {
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;
    }
    .campaign-details p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
    }
    .footer p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>HiveK Campaign Operations</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h2>Collaboration Revoked</h2>
        <p>Hello,</p>
        <p>We are writing to inform you that your access as a collaborator for the following campaign has been revoked:</p>
        <div class="campaign-details">
          <p><strong>Campaign ID:</strong> {{campaignId}}</p>
          <p><strong>Description:</strong> {{description}}</p>
        </div>
        <p>You will no longer be able to manage or operate this campaign. If you believe this is in error, please contact the campaign owner.</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br>The HiveK Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>© 2026 HiveK Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
